    "detailed_description": "Draft a synergistic grid of units, each with their own powerful abilities that can be combined in unexpected ways.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/store.gif?t=1743361392\" /></div><br><br>Correct arrangement is everything, and can result in powerful cascading effects.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/95f4b18717cbb2c62ed327062de5457f.poster.avif?t=1743361392\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/95f4b18717cbb2c62ed327062de5457f.webm?t=1743361392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/95f4b18717cbb2c62ed327062de5457f.mp4?t=1743361392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Progress through the ranks as you master the game. Maybe there are fewer limitations than you imagined?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/e098201321981a8779ffd9d3a2247808.poster.avif?t=1743361392\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/e098201321981a8779ffd9d3a2247808.webm?t=1743361392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/e098201321981a8779ffd9d3a2247808.mp4?t=1743361392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Uncover a mysterious story about the origin of the game, told in short fragments.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/562259d500e42aaac79e25498614612d.poster.avif?t=1743361392\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/562259d500e42aaac79e25498614612d.webm?t=1743361392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105840/extras/562259d500e42aaac79e25498614612d.mp4?t=1743361392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
